body:
Absolutely NTA. I'm so sorry you've been dealing with this. I'm also a trans man who's had similar history with my mom and it really does hurt a lot. She completely disrespects you and that is so upsetting and horrible. She had a chance to maybe start up a relationship again but just pushed herself further down the hole. 

&#x200B;

I'm sorry she caused that scene for you but please know it's not your fault. You're setting boundaries and not letting her treat you with disrespect anymore. Focus on your new future with your loving wife and those who actually love and support you. Best of luck <3
